# 📦 Olist E-Commerce Delivery & Customer Satisfaction Dashboard

An executive-ready Power BI dashboard analyzing **96,470** Brazilian e-commerce orders from the Olist dataset to uncover how logistics performance and shipping delays impact customer review scores.

![Dashboard Preview](assets/dashboard_preview.png)

## 🎯 Business Problem & Objectives
Customer retention in e-commerce relies heavily on reliable delivery timelines. This project evaluates Olist's order fulfillment pipeline to:
* Measure baseline delivery efficiency (**On-Time Rate** and **Average Delivery Time**).
* Quantify the direct correlation between late deliveries and low customer ratings.
* Track delivery performance scalability across monthly order volume growth.
* Identify specific product categories experiencing the longest transit bottlenecks.

## 📊 Key Metrics & Insights
* **Total Orders Analyzed:** 96,470
* **Overall On-Time Delivery Rate:** 91.89%
* **Average Delivery Time:** 12.09 Days
* **Primary Driver of Dissatisfaction:** Late deliveries disproportionately account for **1-star reviews**, whereas 5-star reviews are overwhelmingly fulfilled on time.
* **Volume vs. Efficiency:** As monthly order volume scaled across 2017–2018, maintaining consistent on-time delivery required tighter logistical control during peak shopping periods.

## 🛠️ Tools & Techniques Used
* **Power BI Desktop:** Data modeling, DAX measures (`Total Orders`, `On-Time Rate %`, `Avg Delivery Days`), and interactive visual design.
* **Data Visualization Best Practices:** Applied high data-ink ratio principles, semantic color coding (Navy for on-time, Coral Red for late), and hierarchical drill-downs.

